  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats are made with high-density TPE material, using advanced 3D laser technology, which not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear resistance but also offers a precise fit to your vehicle floor.\nFitment\n2023-2026 Chevrolet Chevy Colorado Crew Cab/GMC Canyon\nONLY for carpet flooring.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These chevy colorado all weather floor mats are compatible with 2023 2024 2025 2026 Chevrolet Chevy Colorado Crew Cab/GMC Canyon; 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back.\nBuilt For Durability: YITAMOTOR floor mats for gmc canyon 2023 2024 2025 2026 are made from premium TPE material featuring high tensity for great comfort and wear-resistance while remaining flexible and user-friendly even in extreme cold or hot environments; Product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC.\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: Uniquely chevy colorado 2023 2024 2025 2026 all season floor liner designed channels and raised edge can effectively trap liquid, debris, snow, mud, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; Built-in retainer clips to firmly grip the mat and prevent slipping when wet.\nEasy To Clean: Simply shake the dirt out of the textured skid-resistant surface or spray down with a hose; No vacuuming or harsh chemicals needed for maintenance.\nWhy Choose Yitamotor: Our 2026 2025 2024 2023 chevy colorado rubber car mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle.",
  "highlights": [
    "They securely attach to your vehicle using the original factory clasps, keeping the floor liners firmly in place and preventing unwanted shifting during daily driving.",
    "The raised edges provide maximum vehicle coverage, Floor Liners accurately and completely line the vehicle carpet giving absolute interior protection.",
    "Specially designed channels ensure the liner effectively contain the liquid to keep your vehicle and shoes clean, non-slip design for safe driving."
  ],
